{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":2773,"name":"Toufeeq  Pasha","username":"Toufeeq_Pasha","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.availproject.org/toufeeq_pasha/{size}/858_2.png","created_at":"2025-01-20T13:48:32.586Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReport Author\u003c/strong\u003e: Toufeeq from the Avail Technical Committee [5CoVaWrZnaV3BSeUJCA8Ca3SPMJDtjT1zPvZkzovkxJU7dkr]\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eChange Executed\u003c/strong\u003e: Changes will be applied at block \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#877\u003c/span\u003e,679\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Committee Consensus\u003c/strong\u003e: 5/7 signers \u003ca href=\"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/25?tab=votes\"\u003ehttps://avail.subscan.io/tech/25?tab=votes\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntroduction:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThis report aims to provide transparency to the Avail community regarding both upcoming and executed network changes. The Avail Technical Committee (TC) has approved a runtime upgrade on Avail Mainnet to increase the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e to 75% from the current 50%. After a detailed review of the upgrade’s effectiveness, impact, and security, the TC reached a majority consensus (5/7) to proceed with the changes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProposed / Executed Changes:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe proposal to increase the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e to 75% was introduced and discussed in the community through \u003ca href=\"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-12-increase-ideal-staking-ratio-to-75/1632\"\u003eAIP 5\u003c/a\u003e. This upgrade also increases the MaxBlockCols limit to 1024, which allows governance to increase the block size up to 32 MB.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCode Modifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFor those interested, you can review the necessary code modifications in the following PR:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/650\"\u003ePR1\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePotential Merits to the Network:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe change to the \u003cstrong\u003eideal_stake\u003c/strong\u003e parameter is applied via a runtime upgrade and does not affect the consensus mechanism or validator operations. The network will continue to function as intended, with no disruptions for participants. This upgrade is aligned with network scaling, ensures sustainable APY, and strengthens network security.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you require any additional resources or information, please feel free to drop comments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-01-27T14:58:16.015Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":101,"reads":19,"readers_count":18,"score":613.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":1640,"topic_slug":"transparency-report-12-increased-ideal-stake-to-75","display_username":"Toufeeq  Pasha","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://github.com/availproject/avail/pull/650","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"migrated to FungibleAdapter by ToufeeqP · Pull Request #650 · availproject/avail · GitHub","clicks":5},{"url":"https://avail.subscan.io/tech/25?tab=votes","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Subscan | Aggregate Substrate ecological network high-precision Web3 explorer","clicks":2},{"url":"https://forum.availproject.org/t/aip-5-increase-ideal-staking-ratio-to-75/1632","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"AIP 5: Increase Ideal Staking R